
@startuml
title Banking Concurrency Simulator - Domain Model (v1)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Domain" {
    class BankAccount {
        - accountNumber: AccountNumber
        - balance: int

        + BankAccount(accountNumber: AccountNumber, balance: int)
        + getAccountNumber(): AccountNumber
        + getBalance(): int
        + deposit(amount: int): boolean
        + withdraw(amount: int): boolean
        + canDeposit(amount: int): boolean
        + canWithdraw(amount: int): boolean
    }

    class AccountNumber <<record>> {
        + value: String

        + AccountNumber(value: String)
        + compareTo(other: AccountNumber): int
    }
}

BankAccount *-- AccountNumber : identifies

note right of BankAccount
    Thread safety:
    - Balance operations are synchronized.
    - Negative balances are not allowed.
    - Zero or negative transaction
      amounts are rejected.
    - Balance overflow is prevented.

    Monetary amounts are represented
    as int in v1.
end note

note right of AccountNumber
    Immutable value object.

    Account numbers are normalized
    and validated as 26 digits.

    Implements Comparable to support
    deterministic lock ordering.
end note

@enduml
